3-d42f-4867-a5be-3a20ae35e848.jpeg"},"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Related","section_type":"normalPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":6413,"title":"","description":"41","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Adventure","Fantasy","Romance","Family"],"id":6413,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Stardust","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk52/shows/e597c7a4-e872-46c4-be23-f3fa93e5e3b3.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk58/shows/74622a6e-556a-40cd-9cf8-50900ee41f85.jpg","likes":342,"dislikes":6,"views":23305,"release_date":"1186704000000","length":7661,"description":"The passage from this world to the fantasy kingdom of Stormhold is through a breach in a wall beside an English village. In the 1800s, a boy becomes a man when he ventures through the breach in pursuit of a fallen star, to prove his love for the village beauty. The star is no lump of rock, it's a maiden, Yvaine. Tristan, the youth, is not the only one looking for her: three witches, led by Lamia, want her heart to make them young; and, the sons of the dead king of Stormhold want her because she holds a ruby that will give one of them title to the throne. Assisting Tristan are his mother, the victim of a spell, and a cross-dressing pirate of the skies. Will Tristan win his true love?","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.7}],"value":7.7,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":6413,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}